                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">indirect benefits</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In addition to the above, the concessions offered by these countries directly to
                    each other will result in substantial benefits to United States trade. In the
                    time available it has not been possible to make a full analysis of these offers,
                    but it is estimated that the U.S. trade benefited would exceed $150,000,000.</p>
